stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR

    [*] --> Starting
    Starting --> Listening: transport ready
    Listening --> DirectConnecting: mDNS or known contact
    Listening --> RelayConnecting: relay configured
    DirectConnecting --> Online: presence verified
    RelayConnecting --> Online: relay connected
    Online --> Syncing: cursor request
    Syncing --> Online: sync complete
    Online --> Online: heartbeat
    Online --> Reconnecting: connection lost
    Reconnecting --> Online: backoff succeeds
    Reconnecting --> Offline: all paths failed
    Offline --> Starting: app restart

